
@url = http://localhost:3000

### REGISTRO DE USUARIO
POST {{url}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Gonzalo Pereyra",
  "email": "pereyra@gmail.com",
  "password": "pereyra123"
}

### INICIO DE SESION
# @name login
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pereyra@gmail.com",
  "password": "pereyra123"
}

### CONSULTAR VEHICULOS SIN TOKEN
GET {{url}}/vehiculos

### CONSULTAR VEHICULOS CON TOKEN
GET {{url}}/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
